# --- Lobby log (browser → POST /api/lobbies/<id>/lobby-log) ---
# Floor: only lines with severity >= this are sent. Lower name = more verbose / noisier.
# Order (most → least noisy): log, info, warn, error, critical. Use `off` to disable.
# Unset VITE_LOBBY_LOG_THRESHOLD → off (no client lobby_log from this path).
# VITE_LOBBY_LOG_THRESHOLD=off

# --- Battle sync floor: global_constants.js + global_constants.php (not .env) ---
